shape: sequence_diagram

PC: Computador (testar_uart.py)
UART_HW: UART0 (hardware)
ISR: uart_isr
Fila: Fila rx_q
Main: Laco do main
LED: LED RGB

PC -> UART_HW: "A5 R G B ACAO CHECK (115200 8N1)"
UART_HW -> ISR: interrupcao RX
ISR -> Fila: k_msgq_put() por byte
Main -> Fila: k_msgq_get()
Main -> Main: "ID == 0xA5? CHECK confere?"
Main -> LED: "run_command() (PWM ou GPIO)"
